[00:44.48] The clouds prepare for battle
[00:49.01] In the dark and brooding silence
[00:53.08] Bruised and sullen stormclouds
[00:57.70] Have the light of day obscured
[01:02.26] Looming low and ominous
[01:06.25] In twilight premature
[01:10.35] Thunderheads are rumbling in a distant overture
[04:19.28] All at once, the clouds are parted
[04:23.57] Light streams down in bright unbroken beams
[06:43.74] Follow men's eyes as they look to the skies
[06:56.17] The shifting shafts of shining weave the fabric of their dreams
